          "| **2\ufe0f\u20e3 New User Signs Up** | The referred colleague clicks the link, lands on our sign\u2011up page, and completes the registration. | The link pre\u2011populates their \u201cReferred By\u201d field so we know who introduced them. |",
          "| **3\ufe0f\u20e3 Automated Welcome Email** | Once the account is created, they receive a personalized welcome email that includes: <br>\u2022 A quick start guide <br>\u2022 Links to our knowledge base <br>\u2022 Contact info for the support team | Sets expectations and gives them the resources they need right away. |",
          "| **4\ufe0f\u20e3 Onboarding Task Created** | A task is automatically created in their CRM (or in your own system if you\u2019re using ours) titled \u201cComplete First Setup.\u201d | Keeps the new user focused on the essential steps. |",
