          "| **6\ufe0f\u20e3 Progress Tracking** | As they complete each milestone (e.g., \u201cImport Contacts,\u201d \u201cSet Up First Campaign\u201d), the system updates their relationship metrics (trust, commitment, lead score). | Gives you visibility into how quickly they\u2019re adopting the platform. |",
          "| **7\ufe0f\u20e3 Referral Reward** | Once the new user completes the first paid plan (or a set milestone), you receive your referral credit\u2014either a discount on your next invoice or a credit toward future services. | Incentivizes you to keep referring great people. |",
